# Captured machine states. Deliberately not tracked: a snapshot is a whole
# emulated machine, it is only valid for the emulator commit pyproject.toml
# pins, and it is reproduced by playing to the state again. Keep the ones you
# need; do not expect them to survive a pin move.
snaps/
